        "r2": { "type": "reason", "settings": { "n": "02", "title": "It is free, it is silent, and it is already in your hand", "body": "Every other bad habit costs money, or forces you outside, or somebody smells it on you. This one costs nothing, makes no noise, and nobody ever knows. There is not one single wall between you and it. That is exactly why it has grown for years without anyone stopping it." } },
